          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Arithmetic Expressions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.087,
            0.61,
            0.182
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) Find the total height of the window by writing an expression describing the relationship among the measurements shown in the picture."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.2,
            0.434,
            0.221
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Removing Brackets—I"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.231,
            0.543,
            0.251
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us find the value of this expression,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.309,
            0.255,
            0.449,
            0.274
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "2 0 0 - ( 4 0 \\pm 3 ) ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.279,
            0.61,
            0.336
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We first evaluate the expression inside the bracket to 43 and then subtract it from 200. But it is simpler to first subtract 40 from 200:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.627,
            0.071,
            0.914,
            0.293
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.627,
                0.071,
                0.914,
                0.293
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_11_image_6.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.424,
            0.34,
            0.574,
            0.359
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "200-40=160."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.365,
            0.478,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "And then subtract 3 from 160:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.429,
            0.389,
            0.573,
            0.407
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "160 - 3 = 157."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.412,
            0.783,
            0.432
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What we did here was 200 – 40 – 3. Notice, that we did not do"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.436,
            0.566,
            0.456
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "200-40+3."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.462,
            0.188,
            0.48
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.361,
            0.485,
            0.638,
            0.504
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_13.jpg",
          "content": "200-(40+3)=200-40-3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.519,
            0.848,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 12:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " We also saw this earlier in the case of Irfan purchasing a biscuit packet (₹15) and a toor dal packet (₹56). When he paid ₹100, the change he gets in rupees is:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.4,
            0.587,
            0.598,
            0.606
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "100-(15+56)=29."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.61,
            0.723,
            0.631
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The change could also have been calculated as follows:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.635,
            0.818,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) First subtract the cost of the biscuit packet (15) from 100:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.43,
            0.66,
            0.567,
            0.678
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_18.jpg",
          "content": "100-15=85."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.25,
            0.689,
            0.849,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This is the amount the shopkeeper owes Irfan if he had purchased only the biscuits. As he has purchased toor dal also, its cost is taken from this remaining amount of 85."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.75,
            0.848,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) So, to find the change, we need to subtract the cost of toor dal from 85."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.792,
            0.562,
            0.811
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_21.jpg",
          "content": "85 - 56 = 29."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.251,
            0.822,
            0.695,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What we have done here is 100 – 15 – 56. So,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.35,
            0.847,
            0.648,
            0.866
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_11_equation_23.jpg",
          "content": "100-(15+56)=100-15-56."
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.448,
            0.97,
            0.551,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.87,
            0.849,
            0.91
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Notice how upon "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "removing the brackets preceded by a negative sign",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", the signs of the terms inside the brackets change. Observe"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
